    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game nostalgia about the wonderful days of childhood and dreams of space. And, of course, about beloved toys. Each of us dreamed of becoming an astronaut and going on a space adventure during our childhood... Perhaps this game will awaken your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a group of robots, plan your moves, collect batteries, and avoid traps. This is a game about attentiveness and cleverness in a nostalgic setting of a child's dream of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features of the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mechanics for simultaneous control of a group of robots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules, but genuinely challenging puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All images are hand-drawn </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game nostalgia about the wonderful days of childhood and dreams of space. And, of course, about beloved toys. Each of us dreamed of becoming an astronaut and going on a space adventure during our childhood... Perhaps this game will awaken your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a group of robots, plan your moves, collect batteries, and avoid traps. This is a game about attentiveness and cleverness in a nostalgic setting of a child's dream of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features of the game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mechanics for simultaneous control of a group of robots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple rules, but genuinely challenging puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All images are hand-drawn </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "To Get There is a turn-based puzzle. Manage a group of robots, plan your moves, collect energy sources, and avoid traps. Simple and intuitive mechanics, but truly challenging levels that require attention and strategic planning.",
